  <item>
    <title>Vol.2 凉粉凉面叶儿粑、小面燃面你我他，聊聊那些好会的川渝小吃</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66616da563c334a2fbc53bca</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66616da563c334a2fbc53bca</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 07 Jun 2024 01:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsg9N399eyKYS1Dbu5qEbUs1jQv4.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>主播｜啵啵 逗号 酸 苏27</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>在这期节目中，四位生活在北京的川渝籍主播为大家聊聊那些发源自家乡，火遍大江南北的各式川渝小吃，特别之处是我们把几款小吃带到了录制现场，边吃边聊，更有代入感得让主播们回味记忆的味道，我们不仅能吃能聊，还能亲手下厨制作这些小吃，也为听众分享一些下厨的技艺。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> [小麦类] 重庆小面与其他川渝家常面条</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="869">14:29</a> [小麦类] 凉面是川渝人最爱的消夏主食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1363">22:43</a> [小麦类] 传统小吃蛋烘糕，最能体现成都人包容混杂的口味&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a> [糯米类] 可甜可咸的传统小吃叶儿粑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> [糯米类] 早餐热量炸弹：糖油果子、糯米团和油茶</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2745">45:45</a> [淀粉类] 淀粉类小吃代表：凉粉与粉条</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3072">51:12</a> [肉类] 最佳下酒伴侣：麻辣牛肉干</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3371">56:11</a> [肉类] 做蒜泥白肉最重要的是选肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3575">59:35</a> 走出川渝，流行于全国的小吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3940">1:05:40</a> 火遍全国的冰粉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkq2CqlHam9puz-yf_ZKJBv0caVp.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn4jPFmmjISz-XtS0Y03RwyJmgB_.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp7kx7T_YoLBEhqvCK1D8tyYsuI-.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkAURyhJ5sC6ltprKfCw3Yv8gGWz.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuBb3WnWYRITUEXn7jMp6-KZSCOQ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuMVEfPeMH7DyT8jbka8sRfLY1jX.png"></figure><span></span><h2><strong><span>音乐</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>《Theme From Scent of a Woman》柴亮 / &nbsp;代博 / &nbsp;瑞鸣</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>微信：Hui_xps</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：lansjtu@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
