  <item>
    <title>Vol.01从一本半个世纪前的菜谱聊聊家常川菜的故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662d054a5fb33c1b2bf21e8e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662d054a5fb33c1b2bf21e8e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 28 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrBI3iWOlcbxYfPAuvchbBkEVfbW.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>主播｜啵啵 逗号 酸</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是《什锦闲话》第一期，我们从逗号老师一本半个世纪前的传家菜谱开始，聊聊记忆中的家常川菜以及背后难以忘怀的味觉故事，三位主播都是常年生活在北京的四川人，爱吃爱玩，兴趣广泛，希望通过这档播客节目为大家的生活增添一点滋味。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a></span></strong><span> 一本1979年出版的川菜菜谱是什么样的</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a></span></strong><span> 川菜不仅是麻辣，家常川菜究竟是什么样的</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a></span></strong><span> 味道多元的家常川菜</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a></span></strong><span> 四川人对味道的包容性，豆花咸甜都可以</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2010">33:30</a></span></strong><span> 可能是争议最大的一道川菜：鱼香肉丝</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2680">44:40</a></span></strong><span> 乐山人的家庭钵钵鸡</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3453">57:33</a></span></strong><span> 冒烤鸭的美味回忆</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3740">1:02:20</a></span></strong><span> 四川人在冬至时节与羊肉汤的故事</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3980">1:06:20</a></span></strong><span> 不管生活怎样忙碌，我们都保持着对做饭的热爱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4950">1:22:30</a></span></strong><span> 分享我们擅长做的菜</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5340">1:29:00</a></span></strong><span> 北京哪家餐馆可以吃到家常川菜</span></p><span></span><p><span>《大众川菜》1979年版</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr6aMW4E-8aXABcuKf1X1D_Brggf.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>甜烧白</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrRTX1r4Bva3i-gXSzFVudphr2sO.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>家常烧菜：苦瓜烧鸭、土豆烧牛肉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvIeJQe_XeJlqS-fpX-bw__eYZni.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>鲍鱼红烧肉</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgn3Hi5z_TJYw3Bc01WuPxNmJtfE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>烧什锦</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnbsrE6UO99lSE_leoncG4uxhFcQ.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>自己做的钵钵鸡</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtGIKecybtFwGT3doINEBRfZRNEk.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>韭黄炒肉丝</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsiNop4XIrV-jDKheeB1JPogGdGD.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>提及的书</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《大众川菜》</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/1484084/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/1484084/"><span>book.douban.com（该链接为1984年版）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《细说川菜》</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/3187449/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/3187449/"><span>book.douban.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《川菜杂谈》</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/1019716/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/1019716/"><span>book.douban.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提及的餐厅</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>三样菜</span></p><span></span><p><span>张妈妈川菜馆</span></p><span></span><p><span>懒人业余餐厅（崔各庄店）</span></p><span></span><p><span>静园川菜</span></p><span></span><p><span>不相离盐帮菜</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Aria, BWV 1068/Jacques Loussier joue Bach No.2/Jacques Loussier</span></p><span></span><p><span>Air/Till Brönner/At The End Of The Day</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微信：Hui_xps</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：lansjtu@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
